personal skills,big data,programming languages"},{"title":"ETL Developer","company":"Prowerse Tech","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-17","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-etl-developer-prowerse-ahmedabad-4-to-6-years-170926922794","source":"naukri","experience":"4-6 Yrs","skills":[6,12,15,30],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Experience with cloud data platforms (Azure preferred)\n\n 4+ years of ETL development experience\n\nExperience with Synapse,Databricks,or Snowflake\n\nKey Skills: C#,.NET,ETL,SQL,Azure Data Factory,ADF,and .NET,Blob Storage"},{"title":"Team Lead - Data Engineer","company":"Dynatech Systems","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-team-lead-data-engineer-dynatech-systems-ahmedabad-5-to-10-years-160926502396","source":"naukri","experience":"5-10 Yrs","skills":[1,12,14,15,19,20,30,31,104],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Team Lead - Data Engineer Data Engineering Full Time India Job Summary We are seeking a highly skilled Senior Data Engineer with expertise in Databricks and Microsoft Data Platform technologies. The ideal candidate should have extensive experience in designing enterprise-scale data solutions, developing data pipelines, and implementing modern data architectures using Databricks and Microsoft technologies such as Azure Data Factory (ADF), Azure Synapse Analytics, or Microsoft Fabric Key Responsibilities Design and implement scalable data architectures and data pipelines. Develop and optimize ETL/ELT solutions using Databricks. Build data ingestion frameworks for batch and real-time processing. Lead data integration projects using Azure Data Factory, Synapse Analytics, or Microsoft Fabric. Implement Delta Lake and Lakehouse architectures. Optimize Spark workloads and ensure efficient resource utilization. Collaborate with Solution Architects, Business Analysts, and Data Scientists. Define and enforce data governance, security, and quality standards. Mentor junior data engineers and conduct technical reviews. Support CI/CD implementation and DevOps practices for data platforms. Required Skills Qualifications 5+ years of experience in Data Engineering. Mandatory hands-on experience with Databricks. Strong expertise in Python and PySpark. Experience with at least one Microsoft data platform: Azure Data Factory (ADF), or Azure Synapse Analytics, or Microsoft Fabric Strong SQL and data modeling experience. Experience with Delta Lake and Lakehouse architecture. Experience working with Azure cloud services. Knowledge of data warehousing concepts and dimensional modeling. Familiarity with Git, Azure DevOps, and CI/CD practices. Preferred Qualifications Experience with real-time streaming using Spark Structured Streaming. Knowledge of Power BI and semantic models. Experience with data governance and security frameworks. Exposure to Snowflake, AWS, or other cloud data platforms. \n\nDisclaimer: This job posting has been aggregated from external source. Role details, content, and availability are subject to change. Applicants are advised to confirm the latest information directly on the company website before applying.\n\nKey Skills: GIT,Data modeling,spark,Cloud,data governance,power bi,microsoft,Analytics"},{"title":"Senior Data Engineer - Data Mining & Wrangling","company":"Unico Connect","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-senior-data-engineer-data-mining-wrangling-unico-connect-private-limited-ahmedabad-10-to-12-years-160926935133","source":"naukri","experience":"10-12 Yrs","skills":[2,5,12,13,30,31,32],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Key Responsibilities :\n\n- Understand the factories , manufacturing process , data availability and avenues for improvement\n\n- Brainstorm , together with engineering, manufacturing and quality problems that can be solved using the acquired data in the data lake platform.\n\n- Define what data is required to create a solution and work with connectivity engineers , users to collect the data\n\n- Create and maintain optimal data pipeline architecture.\n\n- Assemble large, complex data sets that meet functional / non-functional business requirements.\n\n- Identify, design, and implement internal process improvements: automating manual processes, optimizing data delivery for greater scalability\n\n- Work on data preparation, data deep dive , help engineering, process and quality to understand the process/ machine behavior more closely using available data\n\n- Deploy and monitor the solution\n\n- Work with data and analytics experts to strive for greater functionality in our data systems.\n\n- Work together with Data Architects and data modeling teams.\n\n Skills /Competencies :\n\n- Good knowledge of the business vertical with prior experience in solving different use cases in the manufacturing or similar industry\n\n- Ability to bring cross industry learning to benefit the use cases aimed at improving manufacturing process\n\nProblem Scoping/definition Skills :\n\n- Experience in problem scoping, solving, quantification\n\n- Strong analytic skills related to working with unstructured datasets.\n\n- Build processes supporting data transformation, data structures, metadata, dependency and workload management.\n\n- Working knowledge of message queuing, stream processing, and highly scalable 'big data' data stores\n\n- Ability to foresee and identify all right data required to solve the problem\n\nData Wrangling Skills :\n\n- Strong skill in data mining, data wrangling techniques for creating the required analytical dataset\n\n- Experience building and optimizing 'big data' data pipelines, architectures and data sets\n\n- Adaptive mindset to improvise on the data challenges and employ techniques to drive desired outcomes\n\nProgramming Skills :\n\n- Experience with big data tools: Spark, Delta, CDC, NiFi, Kafka, etc\n\n- Experience with relational SQL ,NoSQL databases and query languages, including oracle , Hive, sparkQL.\n\n- Experience with object-oriented languages: Scala, Java, C++ etc.\n\nVisualization Skills :\n\n- Know how of any visualization tools such as PowerBI, Tableau\n\n- Good storytelling skills to present the data in simple and meaningful manner\n\nData Engineering Skills :\n\n- Strong skill in data analysis techniques to generate finding and insights by means of exploratory data analysis\n\n- Good understanding of how to transform and connect the data of various types and form\n\n- Great numerical and analytical skills\n\n- Identify opportunities for data acquisition\n\n- Explore ways to enhance data quality and reliability\n\n- Build algorithms and prototypes\n\n- Reformulating existing frameworks to optimize their functioning.\n\n- Good understanding of optimization techniques to make the system performant for requirements.\n\nKey Skills: Data Engineering,Data Mining,Java,NoSQL,Data Wrangling,Scala,Big Data,Data Visualization"},{"title":"Data Center Engineer","company":"Cradlepoint","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-data-center-engineer-cradlepoint-part-of-ericsson-ahmedabad-2-to-4-years-160926501583","source":"naukri","experience":"2-4 Yrs","is_walkin":false,"description":"Willingness to work during non-business hours or in shifts as required by operational needs\n\nThe roles and responsibilities of the build and support Engineer are: Operational activities (not limited to): - Work on tickets assigned to fix incidents in the data center on-site visit is required\n\nKey Skills: Ticketing,operational support,Data center operations,Issue resolution,Cable laying,Asset management,Troubleshooting,Remote support"},{"title":"Data Engineer","company":"Dynatech Systems","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-data-engineer-dynatech-systems-ahmedabad-3-to-8-years-160926502395","source":"naukri","experience":"3-8 Yrs","skills":[1,20,30],"is_walki